      "message": "That is a carryover from the current impl: https://cs.android.com/h/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:hardware/google/gfxstream/host/vulkan/VkDecoderGlobalState.cpp;drc\u003d53b16ae9b8eb36e2c8b1f42a6f7c5a9982f0c143;l\u003d8329.\n\nIIUC, this is because `BoxedHandleManager` is a combination of a `HybridEntityManager` \"Store\" plus a reverse lookup map. Most of the \"boxed_*\" functions interact with just the \"Store\" which has all of the lock\u0027ing built into ` `HybridEntityManager` but the few functions which interact with the reverse lookup map have to use another lock. I will do another cleanup change shortly which replaces `getBoxedFromUnboxedLocked()` with a `getBoxedFromUnboxed()` and adds a `GUARDED_BY(mMutex)` on the reverse map.",
